# OS/2 Warp 4.52 - BeagleV-Ahead (T-Head TH1520) boot environment
#
# Generated by CMake from bootloader/beaglev_ahead_uEnv.txt.in. Copy this
# file and @KERNEL_IMAGE@ to the first (FAT) partition of a microSD card.
# On the BeagleV-Ahead, eMMC is mmc 0 and the microSD slot is mmc 1.
#
# If the U-Boot on your board doesn't import uEnv.txt from the microSD
# card, stop autoboot on the serial console and boot by hand:
#   load mmc 1:1 @KERNEL_LOAD_ADDR@ @KERNEL_IMAGE@
#   booti @KERNEL_LOAD_ADDR@ - ${fdtcontroladdr}
#
# The image is linked at @KERNEL_LOAD_ADDR@ (DRAM base + the Image
# header's text_offset, kernel/beaglev_linker.ld) and must be loaded
# there. booti needs a device tree argument, so U-Boot's own control DT is
# passed; the kernel ignores it.
os2_addr=@KERNEL_LOAD_ADDR@
os2_image=@KERNEL_IMAGE@
uenvcmd=echo Booting OS/2 Warp (${os2_image}) ...; load mmc 1:1 ${os2_addr} ${os2_image} && booti ${os2_addr} - ${fdtcontroladdr}
